  "description": "<p data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"164\"><strong data-end=\"210\" data-start=\"164\">Welcome to the Dexter Co Affiliate Program</strong></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"164\"><em data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"213\"></em></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"164\"><em data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"213\"></em><em data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"213\">Elegant Cannabis Storage. Elevated Social Experiences.</em></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"164\"></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"164\">Dexter Co was born from a desire to create more meaningful connections&mdash;sparked by a midlife awakening, a surprise fourth daughter, and a deep need to replace burnout with beauty and purpose. We design refined, design-forward cannabis accessories that look as good on your bar cart as they feel in your hand.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"164\"></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"164\">Our mission is simple: to transform cannabis from something hidden into something celebrated&mdash;gracefully integrated into social gatherings, rituals, and everyday hospitality. Think less &ldquo;headshop,&rdquo; more &ldquo;heirloom.&rdquo; From handcrafted storage to conversation-sparking sets, every Dexter Co piece is made to elevate the experience of getting together.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"164\"></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"164\">As a Dexter Co affiliate, you&rsquo;re not just selling products&mdash;you&rsquo;re helping redefine how the world connects. We offer generous commissions, creative assets, and a brand that stands out in a crowded market with authenticity, elegance, and a wink of humor.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1232\" data-start=\"1182\"></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1232\" data-start=\"1182\">Let&rsquo;s get together&mdash;and get paid while we&rsquo;re at it.</p>",
